WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.417
Practice warning only.

00:00:01.417 --> 00:00:04.379
You are inside a sturdy house with a basement.

00:00:04.379 --> 00:00:07.857
Go to the interior of the basement, away from windows.

00:00:07.857 --> 00:00:11.785
Get under something sturdy if you can, and protect your head.

00:00:11.785 --> 00:00:13.524
Do not watch from a window.

00:00:13.524 --> 00:00:16.680
Do not try to outrun it in a car from this scene.
